{"version":1,"content":"<p>人工智能公司Anthropic正在繼續推進首次公開募股（IPO）計劃。儘管近期美國科技股經歷大幅拋售，人工智能行業的投資熱情有所降温，同時英偉達CEO黃仁勳捲入的私人關係及間諜指控事件也令市場關注度上升，但Anthropic並未因此改變上市安排。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585708.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.150377+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:51:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"d4074b56d47fdd1d151993be07a32ba210912866c1e8f50e105818a4468d35e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}